'''Nektulos Forest''' is a dark forest that lies north of the [[East Commonlands|Commonlands]] on the eastern half of Antonica. It is home to a clan of halflings, and is also patrolled by the dark elves from nearby [[Neriak]]. It also represents the newbie zone for the dark elves from Neriak.

